	measure 'Last Qualified Windows All AD Accounts Day' = MAXX(FILTER(ALLSELECTED('Date'[Date]), NOT ISBLANK([Total AD Computers Daily]) && NOT ISBLANK([Windows 10 All AD Accounts Daily]) && NOT ISBLANK([Windows 11 All AD Accounts Daily])), 'Date'[Date])
